torcycle, Car, SUV, Scooter, Trucks easy installation (install by professional only) - Universal* Features: Long lasting, low power consumption, energy saving.* Universal fit* 12V for DC power supply.* Led provides more visibility on road, with cool appearance design.High Power and Super Lighting :* Newest Korean CSP LED chips * Super bright with for safe driving at night* 6500K xenon white color, far more than the halogen lamp and HID lamp.Low Energy Consumption and Long Life :* 100,000hrs, Waterproof driver and connectors level IP68* Works underwater! Rainproof driver, housing, and fan works even in extreme situations Universal fit for cars, motorbikes, trucks, and vans Operates on 12V-36V DC, suitable for various vehicles High-power output of 90W for enhanced visibility Unique Yellow, White Light Effect Durable construction for all-weather use Easy to install and maint Safer, More Efficient and High Power * No high voltage and large current startup, no circuit interference and electromagnetic radiation* Fan, driver smaller, installation easier, plug and play, no need to use the original car circuit wiresLamp Low Heat:* Far less than halogen lamp and HID lights, greatly prolongs the service life of lamps and lanterns.* The latest technology to ensure a perfect beam pattern without any dark spots or foggy light* Color \\u0026 Model : The same Like Pictures ShowNote :* Install by professional only.34:T430,Description The LIU HJG Aluminum Clamp is a versatile and durable solution designed for securely mounting fog lights to a variety of vehicles. Crafted from high-quality aluminum, this universal clamp is lightweight yet sturdy, providing a strong grip without adding extra weight to your vehicle. Ideal for off-road vehicles, motorcycles, ATVs, and more, it ensures your fog lights stay firmly in place even during rugged conditions. Key Features: Material: Premium-grade aluminum for long-lasting durability and corrosion resistance. Universal Fit: Compatible with a wide range of vehicles, ensuring a hassle-free installation on motorcycles, SUVs, trucks, and ATVs. Easy Installation: Quick and simple setup with an adjustable clamp design that allows for flexibility in positioning your fog lights. Secure Hold: Designed for firm attachment, keeping your fog lights steady on uneven terrains and tough driving conditions. Lightweight Design: Does not add unnecessary bulk, making it ideal for high-performance vehicles. Package Includes: 1 Set of LIU HJG Aluminum CLAMPS35:T9f1,\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"• Using high-power led lamp beads, long life 10000 hours the above. Brightness equivalent brightness xenon lamp.• 90% of the electrical energy into light energy. power consumption of only ordinary 1/10 of the lamp.• LED TYPE: 4OW Per Light, 3000 Lm• Built-in application-specific integrated headlight constant current drive control 12-80v universal, adapt to a wide range.• Do not destroy the original car structure, mounted directly applicable to all electricity moving cars ,motorcycles.Premium Quality, Long Life, And Low Power Consumption: Made Of Superior Quality Aluminum Alloy And Comprising High-Quality Led Lamps, The Offered HJG Lox Headlight Lamp Has Service Life Over 10,000 Hours. Ip65 Waterproof Headlight With High-Beam And Low Beam, This Light Is Appreciated For Its Enhanced Level Of Clarity And Spectacular Illumination In All Weather Condition.Bright Light For Improved Visibility:HJG L6X Headlight Is A Perfectidition To Motorcycles And Cars For Ensuring Visibility Wherever You Go. By Converting 90% Off The Electrical Energy Into Light Energy, The Integrated Led Lamps Emit Light That Reaches Far Ahead So That You Can Enjoy Your Ride With many conveniences During The Daytime, Night And Bad Weather Conditions.Waterproof \\u0026 Extended Life: Made To Enhance Visibility, The Offered HJG Lox Headlight Is Designed To Withstand All Adverse Conditions Like Water, Bad Weather, And Shocks. Being Durable And Sturdy, This Headlight Is Ideal To Install For Excellent Visibility During The Daytime, Night, And Even In Low Lighting Conditions.Enhanced Operation: The Offered HJG Lox Led HeadlightLamp Is Designed To Perform All The Operations Of Standard Headlight-High Beam \\u0026 Low Beam So You Can See A Much Brighter Path Ahead While Riding Or Driving At Night Or In Low Lighting Conditions. Provided With A Solid, Durable, And Fixed Bracket, It Is Perfect To Install On All Motorcycles, Bikes, And Cars.Quick \\u0026 Easy Installation: Designed For Practicality, This Light Comes With All Accessories That Are Needed To Install It Over The Car Or Motorcycle In An Easy And Quick Manner. Universal Fit For All Makes And Models Oh Motorcycles, Bikes, And Cars.Universal Auxiliary Fog Lamp For All Vehicle (Original HigProduct). 100% Brand and Easy To Install Light Color: White/Yellow with cover. Waterproof, Dust-Proof, Rust-Proof, You Can Use This Headlight Even In Rainy Days •Light Power: 60W - Voltage: 12VDc. Flux: 4900lm-Environment Temperature: -40-55 Cent Degree Range: 300M-Material: Aluminum Alloy • Led Bulb: 3000lm.24:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",null,{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"itemListElement\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":1,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Home\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ListItem\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"position\\\\\\\":2,\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Auxiliary Lights\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"item\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"https://iranimotohub.in/collections/auxiliary-lights\\\\\\\"}]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",null,{\\\"handle\\\":\\\"auxiliary-lights\\\",\\\"initialCollection\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gid://shopify/Collection/555262607677\\\",\\\"handle\\\":\\\"auxiliary-lights\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"A