chi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:T12c0,HJG LIU HJG Gorilla Fog with Wiring Harness Kit Combo Dual Lens 120W Gorilla Projector Foglight New Model with Wiring Foglight Ultra Wide Dual Intensity LED Driving Fog Lights White/Yellow 120W Universal For All Cars & Bikes LIU HJG Gorilla Foglight Combo Kit HJG LIU HJG Gorilla Projector Fog Light with Wiring Harness Kit Combo The LIU HJG Gorilla Projector is a popular fog light known for its enhanced visibility, durability, and styling. It features a red DRL Devil Eye, yellow/white low/high beams, and a heavy-duty, waterproof design. Key Features: Enhanced Visibility:The yellow/white low/high beams provide clear illumination in various weather conditions, including fog and rain. Red DRL Devil Eye:The red daytime running lights add a unique aesthetic and enhance road presence. Durability:The heavy-duty construction and waterproof design ensure reliable performance in challenging conditions • Easy Installation:Many of these lights come with universal mounting brackets, making them easy to install on various vehicles. The HJG Gorilla Fog Dual Lens 120W Gorilla Projector Foglight New Model with Power Adaptor Foglight Ultra Wide Dual Intensity LED Driving Fog Lights White/Yellow (2*60W = 120W Total) Universal For All Cars & Bikes HJG Gorilla Projector Fog with Red DRL Lens 120W New Model LED Fog Light is made with the latest technology and designed to produce the brightest, clearest, and easiest-to-install fog light in the market. The LED lights are designed with high efficiency to deliver a powerful 6000K/1500Lm beam pattern that delivers long-distance illumination and powerful coverage. SUPER BRIGHT & CLEAR FOG LIGHT: High-Intensity LEDs are designed with high transmission lens design to deliver powerful 6000k/1500lm Spot and Flood combo beam to light up the darkness & ensure long-distance illumination during riding. HEAVY-DUTY & PERFECT DESIGN: Its aviation-grade aluminum body with heat sinks offers better heat dissipation to effectively extend the lifespan of the light over 50,000 hours. Besides, a water-resistant & anti-dust design will keep this fog lamp working well in harsh conditions. ADJUSTABLE MOUNTING BRACKET: It comes with adjustable stainless steel mounting brackets so these light pods could be adjusted to perfect lighting angle which makes changing direction flexibly of light beam easier to meet your application-specific needs. WIDE APPLICATIONS: HJG Y Lens LED 45W work light is compatible with all Jeeps, 4×4, Cars, Trucks, Motorcycles, SUVs, ATVs, Boats, etc. that has 9-32V DC battery. Besides, it can also be used in indoor and outdoor applications by connecting it AC to DC converter. WHERE TO MOUNT: You can mount these fog lights on the front bumper, bull bar, and lower bumper opening, front the grill, roof rack, and rear step bumper of your cars to replace the original lights, fog lights, tail lights, reverse lights. Wide Oprating Voltage: 12V-80V (DC) Life Span: 30,000 Hours Life Waterproof & Dustproof: IP67 Types of Beams: Yellow, White, Red Devil Eye Lumens: 9000 Color Tempurature: Yellow-3000K White-6000K Including Box: Pack of 2 Lights Clamps & Installation Tools 1 Wiring Kit PRODUCT FEATURES: 120W Ultra Bright LED Output – Equipped with high-intensity LED chips that deliver powerful illumination for enhanced visibility in dark, foggy, and rainy conditions. High/Low Beam Dual Mode – Adjustable beam settings allow you to switch between wide low beam for city rides and focused high beam for highways or off-road conditions. Triple Devil Eye Color Options – Stylish and aggressive Yellow, White & Red Devil Eye lighting adds a unique look and improves vehicle visibility for others on the road. Premium Waterproof Protection – Built with durable IP-rated waterproof sealing to protect the lights from rain, mud splashes, and harsh environmental conditions. Efficient Heat Dissipation System – Advanced cooling design keeps the light temperature stable, preventing overheating and extending product life. FEATURES: The product includes 2 pcs of Aux light (60W per pc) with coupler to coupler fitting wiring harness kit. SUPER BRIGHT & CLEAR FOG LIGHT: Lens LED pattern High-Intensity LEDs are designed with a high transmission lens design to deliver powerful 6000k/1500lm Spot and Flood combo beam to light up the darkness & ensure long-distance illumination during riding. HEAVY-DUTY & PERFECT DESIGN ADJUSTABLE MOUNTING BRACKET: It comes with adjustable stainless steel mounting brackets so these light pods could be adjusted to perfect lighting angle which makes changing direction flexibly of light beam easier to meet your application-specific needs. Package Includes : 2x HJG LED Lights (60W per pc * 2 = 120W) 1 x Wiring Harness Kit (Coupler to Coupler fitting) Adjustable Brackets 2pc Mounting Clamps4:Tb7e,Each HJG Led Headlight is aligned with the base using laser during manufacturing to ensure a perfect beam pattern.* Open a new era of LED headlights, using the latest optical technology, top LED chips, excellent heat dissipation and so on.* Waterproof Resist most situations and use advanced LED to work even in bad weather such as rain and fog.* Includes a cooling fan to ensure longevity of the headlight bulb.* HJG uses a wide thermal control system to keep the lights cool.* Cold pressed aluminium radiators are 40% lower than standard coolers* The unique design optimises thermal protection and consistent light.* Powerful 12000RPM turbo cooling fan directly cools air through aerodynamic vents to evenly cool each component Cree leads* The chip LED headlights with light source Adopting CSP LED chip,* The surface light is small, the luminous efficiency is the highest, the penetrating power is strong* The concentrating effect is good with waterproof and dust-proof design.* It is plug-and-play machine with a smart radiatorVehicle co